    "attrs": {
      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Fast &amp; slow pointers</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Pigeonhole</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/find-the-duplicate-number/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 287</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Find the Duplicate Number</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Read the array as a linked list where index i points to index nums[i]. Nothing points to 0, so the walk from 0 has a tail and then a loop, and the node where they join has two arrows in: that node is the repeated value. Floyd's tortoise and hare finds it in O(n) time and O(1) space without touching the array.</p>\n"
  },
